{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17938","headline":"秋怀诗十一首 十一 · 韩愈","name":"秋怀诗十一首 十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鲜鲜霜中菊，既晚何用好。\n扬扬弄芳蝶，尔生还不早。\n运穷两值遇，婉娈死相保。\n西风蛰龙蛇，衆木日凋槁。\n由来命分尔，泯灭岂足道。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17938.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17938","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}